VR is honest-to-far (needs embodied real-time rigs, not puppets), but the web prototype needs nothing new: your input in the center, Ralph/Nolan/a fairy arranged around it, each answering from worldview + memory of your last reaction. The day someone laughs so hard the fairy logs it as canon, the format has paid for itself. Want the prototype next, or keep mining formats first?
